# game: an example ~/.config/game/config, the house vibes as a skeleton.
# copy it, keep what you like, add what is yours: your author line for
# the bounce, your public root, your word list for the sweep.

# the lint, as described. nothing described is no lint.
lint width 80
lint rows 25
lint comments
lint print
lint exclaim
lint shout
lint words hyperscaler enterprise-grade blazing-fast load-bearing

# author   Your Name                 the bounce refuses this name in
#                                    the third person
# words    ~/.config/game/sweep.words one word per line the sweep refuses
# public   ../project-root.git        where releases go, from the repo
# exclude  spec-docs/                 left alone by the sweep; repeatable
